{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103378","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103378/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103378/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103378/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103378","id":2885994548,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6sBMg0","number":103378,"title":"Parser Error when a project that references EditorInterface is exported to Android","user":{"login":"goatchurchprime","id":677254,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NzI1NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/677254?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime","html_url":"https://github.com/goatchurchprime","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-02-28T01:58:39Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T06:53:12Z","closed_at":"2025-02-28T06:53:06Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.3 and 4.4.beta3\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable (77dcf97d8) - NixOS #1-NixOS SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu Sep 12 09:13:13 UTC 2024 - X11 - Vulkan (Mobile) - integrated Intel(R) Graphics (ADL GT2) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-1240P (16 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nA the code for a project that references the `EditorInterface` singleton has parser errors when it is exported to the Android platform.  (Not tested with other exports as this is awkward on a nixos computer, but I wouldn't be surprised it it happens for other platforms.) \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAny reference to the `EditorInterface` singleton causes the error:\n`Parser Error: Identifier \"EditorInterface\" not declared in the current scope`\neven when it is protected by an `if Engine.is_editor_hint()` statement.\n\n```GDScript\nextends Control\n\nfunc _ready():\n\tif Engine.is_editor_hint():\n\t\tprint(\"AAA\", EditorInterface, \"BBB\")\n```\n\nDeploy this using the standard Android Build templates, and don't forget to enable `Deploy Remote Debug`\n\nIt even throws an error if the reference to `EditorInterface` is in a function that is never called.\n\nThis issue was encountered when attempting to deploy [in-game block-coding](https://github.com/endlessm/godot-block-coding/issues/196) into VR.\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[editorhint.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19019144/editorhint.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https